Title:
Verify if user can login with valid credentials

Precondition:
User is on login page

Steps:
1. Enter valid username
2. Enter valid password
3. Click Login

Expected Result:
User is redirected to Products page

Title:
Verify error message for an invalid password

Precondition:
User is on login page

Steps:
1. Enter valid username
2. Enter invalid password
3. Click Login

Expected Result:
Error message displayed

Title:
Verify error message for an invalid username

Precondition:
User is on login page

Steps:
1. Enter invalid username
2. Enter valid password
3. Click Login

Expected Result:
Error message displayed

Title:
Verify that the "Add to cart" CTA changes to "Remove" CTA after being clicked

Precondition:
User is on products page

Steps:
1. Click on the "Add to cart" CTA

Expected Result:
CTA changes to the red "Remove"

Title:
Verify the "Add to cart" CTA adds correct amount of products to shopping cart

Precondition:
User is on products page

Steps:
1. Navigate the products page
2. Add 1-3 products to shopping cart
3. Click on cart located in top right corner

Expected Result:
 User should be redirected to a "your cart" page with the correct amount of products selected

Title:
Verify the "Remove" CTA changes to "Add to cart" CTA after being clicked

Precondition:
User is on products page

Steps:
1. Click on "Remove" CTA

Expected Result:
CTA changes back to "Add to cart"

Title:
Verify the "Remove" CTA removes a product from "your cart" page

Precondition:
User has added product(s) to their cart

Steps:
1. Navigate the products page
2. Add 1-3 products to shopping cart
3. Click on cart located in top right corner
4. Click on "Remove" CTA

Expected Result:
Product should be removed from cart

Title:
Verify "Continue Shopping" CTA directs user to "Products" page

Precondition:
User is in "your cart" page

Steps:
1. Locate the "Continue Shopping" cta at the bottom left of the page
2. Click on cta

Expected Result:
User should be redirected to "Products" page

Title:
Verify "Checkout" CTA directs user to "Your Information" page

Precondition:
User is in "your cart" page with product(s)

Steps:
1. Locate the "Checkout" cta at the bottom right of the page
2. Click on cta

Expected Result:
User should be redirected to "Your Information" page

